    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">PRJ302 · Further study</span>\n<h2>Links for further study</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Collected automatically from the syllabus, the slides and the material pack. Some may have moved since the university published them.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">PRJ302 · Học thêm</span>\n<h2>Link học thêm</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Gom tự động từ syllabus, slide và gói tài liệu. Một số link có thể đã đổi chỗ kể từ khi trường công bố.</p></div>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/</a> <small>— syllabus</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/html/home/welcome\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/html/home/welcome</a> <small>— giáo trình</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/introcss/home/welcome\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/introcss/home/welcome</a> <small>— giáo trình</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/javascript/home/welcome\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/javascript/home/welcome</a> <small>— giáo trình</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/responsivedesign/home/welcome\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/responsivedesign/home/welcome</a> <small>— giáo trình</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://library.books24x7.com/toc.aspx?bookid=62587\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://library.books24x7.com/toc.aspx?bookid=62587</a> <small>— giáo trình</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://docs.oracle.com/javase/tutorial/JDBC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://docs.oracle.com/javase/tutorial/JDBC</a> <small>— giáo trình</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/cd/B14099_19/web.1012/b14017/filters.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://docs.oracle.com/cd/B14099_19/web.1012/b14017/filters.htm</a> <small>— giáo trình, kế hoạch buổi</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://docs.oracle.com/javase/tutorial/jdbc/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://docs.oracle.com/javase/tutorial/jdbc/index.html</a> <small>— kế hoạch buổi</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://java.sun.com/xml/ns/j2ee\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://java.sun.com/xml/ns/j2ee</a> <small>— slide Slot 1,2,3,4,5-Basic Web Application, Servlet, tài liệu Slot 1,2,3,4,5-Basic Web Application, Servlet.ppt, tài liệu Slot 1,2,3,4,5-Basic Web Application,…</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://java.sun.com/xml/ns/j2ee/web-app_2_4.xsd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://java.sun.com/xml/ns/j2ee/web-app_2_4.xsd</a> <small>— slide Slot 1,2,3,4,5-Basic Web Application, Servlet, tài liệu Slot 1,2,3,4,5-Basic Web Application, Servlet.ppt, tài liệu Slot 1,2,3,4,5-Basic Web Application,…</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/javase/tutorial/jdbc/basics/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://docs.oracle.com/javase/tutorial/jdbc/basics/index.html</a> <small>— slide Slot 6,7,8,9,10 JDBC, tài liệu Slot 6,7,8,9,10 JDBC.pptx</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://java.sun.com/products/jsp/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://java.sun.com/products/jsp/</a> <small>— slide Slot 11,12,13-Java Server Pages, tài liệu Slot 11,12,13-Java Server Pages.ppt</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://java.sun.com/jsp/jstl/core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://java.sun.com/jsp/jstl/core</a> <small>— slide Slot 21,22-JSTL, tài liệu Slot 21,22-JSTL.ppt</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://java.sun.com/jsp/jstl/xml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://java.sun.com/jsp/jstl/xml</a> <small>— slide Slot 21,22-JSTL, tài liệu Slot 21,22-JSTL.ppt</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://java.sun.com/jsp/jstl/fmt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://java.sun.com/jsp/jstl/fmt</a> <small>— slide Slot 21,22-JSTL, tài liệu Slot 21,22-JSTL.ppt</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://java.sun.com/jsp/jstl/sql\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://java.sun.com/jsp/jstl/sql</a> <small>— slide Slot 21,22-JSTL, tài liệu Slot 21,22-JSTL.ppt</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://java.sun.com/jsp/jstl/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://java.sun.com/jsp/jstl/</a> <small>— slide Slot 21,22-JSTL</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://acme.com/exec/customers?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://acme.com/exec/customers?</a> <small>— slide Slot 21,22-JSTL</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://acme.com/exec/customers?country=USA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://acme.com/exec/customers?country=USA</a> <small>— slide Slot 21,22-JSTL, tài liệu Slot 21,22-JSTL.ppt</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://java.sun.com/jsp/jstl/functions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://java.sun.com/jsp/jstl/functions</a> <small>— slide Slot 21,22-JSTL, tài liệu Slot 21,22-JSTL.ppt</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.apache.org/dist/jakarta/taglibs/standard/binaries/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://www.apache.org/dist/jakarta/taglibs/standard/binaries/</a> <small>— slide Slot 21,22-JSTL, tài liệu Slot 21,22-JSTL.ppt</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://java.sun.com/jsp/jstl/core_rt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://java.sun.com/jsp/jstl/core_rt</a> <small>— slide Slot 21,22-JSTL, tài liệu Slot 21,22-JSTL.ppt</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://api.cohere.ai/v1/generate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://api.cohere.ai/v1/generate</a> <small>— tài liệu Session 15 Using a Database Query Agent in Java Web Applications.docx</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://academy.devbg.org*\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://academy.devbg.org*</a> <small>— tài liệu Slot 19 20, Expression Language.ppt</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://acme.com/exec/customers?country=Japan”/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://acme.com/exec/customers?country=Japan”/</a> <small>— tài liệu Slot 21,22-JSTL.ppt</small></li>\n</ul>"
